# Naming Kuralları

Önce oku: `docs/00_PROJECT/MONOREPO_STRUCTURE.md`, `docs/00_PROJECT/TECH_STACK_DECISIONS.md`, ilgili alan docs klasörü

## TypeScript

- `strict: true`; never `any` — use `unknown`, generics, interfaces
- Prefer `interface` over `type` (except unions)
- Max component 250 lines; hooks prefix `use`; booleans: is/has/can/should

## Naming

- Files/folders: `kebab-case`; components: `PascalCase`; constants: `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE`
- Functions: verb-first (`createReview`, `fetchGames`)

